  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Finreach is a guarantee management company in India, providing default guarantees to lending institutions to MSMEs. The company&#x2019;s mission is to improve credit flow to the MSME segment by enabling lenders to expand their portfolios and product offerings. These lenders tend to be banks or other non-bank financial institutions (&#x201c;NBFIs&#x201d;) that specialise in credit underwriting to the segment.</narrative>
  </description>
